    "title": "Missouri Supreme Court greenlights GOP mid-decade congressional map - Whatfinger News Quick Hits",
    "text": "Missouri’s Supreme Court handed Republicans a decisive victory Tuesday, upholding a new GOP-drawn congressional map and clearing the way for its use ahead of the 2026 midterms. The ruling turned on a question that sounds almost too simple: does a constitutional obligation to redistrict every ten years mean you can only redistrict every ten years?\nFour justices said no. Three dissented.\nRead Full Article: https://conservativeinstitute.org/politics/missouri-supreme-court-greenlights-gop-mid-decade-congressional-map.htm",
